  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malaria control/health response to South Sudanese refugees in Ethiopia - Ethiopia (01-Oct-2019-30-Sep-2020)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia, Malaria, United Nations Children&apos;s Fund (UNICEF Ethiopia)This program has the following goals: By 2017 and beyond, ensure that the population at risk of malaria has universal access to one type of globally recommended vector control intervention.. The objectives of this program are: By 2015 and beyond, ensure and maintain universal access of the population at risk to at least one type of globally recommended anti-vector intervention..  By 2020, all households living in malaria endemic areas will have the knowledge, attitudes and practice towards malaria prevention and control.</narrative>
  </description>
